<span id="A1.T1.5.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Point-to-Point Planning</span>
</span></span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F7F7F7;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T1.5.9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Plan a route from an origin to a destination under a specified travel mode.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F7F7F7;">
<span id="A1.I8" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I8.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I8.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I8.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I8.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">How do I get from Pudong Airport to The Bund by subway?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I8.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I8.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I8.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I8.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Drive from Tsinghua University to Sanlitun now.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I8.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I8.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I8.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I8.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Bike from my location to Zhongshan Park.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.5.10" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<td id="A1.T1.5.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;"><span id="A1.T1.5.10.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">    
<span id="A1.T1.5.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:58.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.10.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Multi-stop Planning</span>
</span></span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T1.5.10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Plan an ordered multi-stop route that visits multiple waypoints sequentially.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.10.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<span id="A1.I9" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I9.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I9.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I9.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I9.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Start from the Grand Hyatt Beijing, stop at Wangfujing Department Store, then proceed to Beijing South Railway Station.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I9.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I9.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I9.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I9.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Travel from Guangzhou South Railway Station to Chimelong Tourist Resort via Tianhe Sports Center.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.5.11" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F7F7F7;">
<td id="A1.T1.5.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;"><span id="A1.T1.5.11.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#F7F7F7;">    
<span id="A1.T1.5.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:58.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Option-Constrained Route Planning</span>
</span></span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F7F7F7;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T1.5.11.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Plan routes based on standard user preferences supported by the routing API (e.g., avoid_tolls, avoid_highways, minimize_transfers).</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.11.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.11.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F7F7F7;">
<span id="A1.I10" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I10.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I10.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I10.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I10.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Drive to the zoo but avoid highways.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I10.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I10.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I10.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I10.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Take public transit with at most one transfer.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I10.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I10.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I10.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I10.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Find the cheapest route to the airport.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T1.5.12" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<td id="A1.T1.5.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;"><span id="A1.T1.5.12.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">    
<span id="A1.T1.5.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:58.7pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Customized Planning</span>
</span></span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T1.5.12.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Plan routes under bespoke constraints that must be satisfied (e.g., designated line/stop/segment).</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T1.5.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.9pt 8.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T1.5.12.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<span id="A1.I11" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I11.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I11.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I11.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I11.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">I must take Metro Line 2; plan the route to the stadium.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I11.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I11.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I11.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I11.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Route to the hospital via People’s Square Station.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I11.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I11.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I11.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I11.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Plan a route to the airport with the fewest traffic lights.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2. </span>Sandbox Tools</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">A core design principle of MobilityBench is to evaluate agents within a realistic yet reproducible tool-use environment. To this end, we provide a comprehensive tool specification table as shown in Table </span><a href="#A1.T2" title="Table S2 ‣ A.2. Sandbox Tools ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ 5. Conclusion ‣ 4.2.3. Model Study ‣ 4.2. Experimental Results ‣ 4.1.4. Experimental Details ‣ 4.1. Experimental Setup ‣ 4. Experiments ‣ MobilityBench: A Benchmark for Evaluating Route-Planning Agents in Real-World Mobility Scenarios" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">S2</span></a><span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">. It documents each tool used in the benchmark sandbox, including the tool name, input arguments and output fields. The sandbox tools are sourced from the AMap Open Platform. More detailed parameter definitions and response field descriptions are available in the official documentation</span><span id="footnote2" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup>
                            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
                            
                            
                            
                          <a href="https://lbs.amap.com/api/webservice/summary" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://lbs.amap.com/api/webservice/summary</a></span></span></span><span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table S2. </span>Overview of map-related tools and their tool-function I/O.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T2.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
